1
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:06,493
(Leonard:)I was reading about this jellyfish
that never dies.

2
00:00:06,706 --> 00:00:09,866
(Leonard:)Instead it reverts to its asexual state
and then grows up again.

3
00:00:10,076 --> 00:00:13,476
(Howard:)We thought my 90-year-old grandfather
had reverted to an asexual state...

4
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,880
(Howard:)...but the lawsuit from his Jamaican
caregiver proved us all wrong.

5
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:20,854
(Leonard:)My point is, immortality is not only
a possibility, it is real.

6
00:00:21,054 --> 00:00:23,384
(Raj:)Only if you're this jellyfish,
which periodically...

7
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:26,390
(Raj:)...reverts to a mass
of undifferentiated protoplasm.

8
00:00:26,593 --> 00:00:29,863
(Sheldon:)If I could keep my Gmail account,
I'd be okay with that.

9
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,830
- Hello, fellas.
- Hey, buddy.

10
00:00:32,999 --> 00:00:35,129
- How are you?
- Remember we were trying to figure out...

11
00:00:35,301 --> 00:00:38,241
...what that smell coming from
Professor Tupperman's office was?

12
00:00:38,438 --> 00:00:40,528
(Leonard:)- Yeah.
- Turns out it was Tupperman.

13
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:43,532
(Barry:)Dead at his desk for two weeks.

14
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:45,871
(Howard:)- Terrible.
- Oh, my God.

15
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:48,739
In lieu of flowers,
the department chair is asking...

16
00:00:48,948 --> 00:00:51,608
...that everyone donate a bottle
of Febreze.

17
00:00:52,685 --> 00:00:55,115
(Sheldon:)If we're going to change the topic
from jellyfish...

18
00:00:55,355 --> 00:00:59,555
(Sheldon:)...I'd be okay with brine shrimp
or the history of the unicycle.

19
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:02,189
Show a little compassion. The man died.

